    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "ほぼ　うごかないが　いきている。 のまずくわずで　からに　こもるうち ちょうのうりょくに　めざめたらしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il ne bouge presque pas, mais il est bien vivant. On dit qu’il aurait découvert ses pouvoirs psychiques à force de jeûner dans sa coquille.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It barely moves, but it’s still alive. Hiding in its shell without food or water seems to have awakened its psychic powers.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ほぼ　動かないが　生きている。 飲まず食わずで　殻に　こもるうち 超能力に　目覚めたらしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "からの　なかで　せいちょうちゅう。 サイコパワーで　そとの　ようすを うかがい　しんかに　そなえている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se développe dans sa coquille et se prépare à évoluer en sondant les alentours grâce à ses pouvoirs psychiques.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "As it grows inside its shell, it uses its psychic abilities to monitor the outside world and prepare for evolution.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "殻の　中で　成長中。 サイコパワーで　外の　様子を うかがい　進化に　備えている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
